      "fixture_sequence": [
        "Publish a v1 human workspace candidate through existing proposal/approval service calls before formal acceptance.",
        "Prepare and observe the v1 human turn with the chosen native; publish the existing synthetic consumption proof only afterward.",
        "Resume that exact generation/native in a real v2 service preparation containing human and automatic entries; assert both descriptors have the same session binding.",
