        "Pin created_at to human 03:00, fillers 02:00 and automatic 01:00 UTC on 2026-11-14; inspect the exact 128/128/6 pages and decode every row before the refusal assertion.",
        "Reopen the source, change server digest or client configuration in its named variant, then request the old native from a new NULL-version turn."
      ],
      "assertions": [
        "409 knowledge_context_changed, descriptor nil, prior empty.",
        "No replacement claim or attempt is finalized on the newly selected task after refusal.",
        "Explicit empty selection yields a distinct valid UUID generation and empty native; preparation retains the human contribution and includes zero paused automatic contributions.",
